# Fall 2026 pilot study — kept local while the study runs, committed at
# publication (May 2027). These name the condition assignment, the directional
# hypothesis and the anchor quiz items; pilot students work in this repo for
# their course project, so committing them would hand participants the
# hypothesis and the answer key. See docs/study/PROTOCOL.md §11.
#
# The WHOLE directory is ignored, deliberately — including docs/study/data/,
# where study data lives and from which no dataset ever enters the repository
# (SPEC.md P-14). Anything added under docs/study/ is private by default;
# a study file that should be public has to be moved out, not un-ignored.
docs/study/

# Local upload storage (STORAGE_PROVIDER=local)
.uploads*/

# Scratch space for throwaway probe scripts — local only, never committed
server/__p/

# Mail the e2e run captures to read verification / reset links (AUTH-3/AUTH-4)
e2e/.mail-e2e.log
